{"availability":"available","full":"13alvone/SpeakesQuery","name":"SpeakesQuery","description":"Pipe-powered search over everything you ingest - on hardware you own.","category":"Other","language":"Python","stars":2,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-11T03:26:52Z","updated":"2026-09-14T18:19:59Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":null,"color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T10:38:43.329Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-03T10:38:43.329Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-03T10:38:43.329Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T10:38:43.329Z","discoveredVia":[],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T10:38:43.329Z","stars":2,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Pipe-powered search over everything you ingest - on hardware you own.","Local-first · zero telemetry · zero cloud dependency · AI when you want it, budget-gated when you do","Quick Start &bull; Features &bull; Docker &bull; Query Syntax &bull; Application Guide &bull; Email Setup"],"features":["Query Engine - Execute queries against local Parquet and SQLite indexes using SpeakesQuery's custom language. Results are displayed in a paginated table with CSV/JSON export, directory tree browsing, and native file…","Semantic Search - | nearest \"query text\" and | dedupsemantic SPQL pipes backed by a local sentence-transformers model (all-MiniLM-L6-v2, 384-dim). A background sweeper pre-computes embedding sidecars for every index so…","Notebooks - A cell-stream workspace where each cell's output feeds the next (SPQL, LLM, markdown, chart cells), with reactive content-hash caching so iterating on a prompt only re-runs what changed. The…","Visual Builder - A drag-drop pipeline canvas backed by the same SPQL grammar with lossless round-trip to query text - the on-ramp for teammates without SPQL fluency. See Visual Builder.","Lookup Management - Upload, download, preview, and delete reference data files (CSV, JSON, TSV, Parquet) through the UI. Lookups augment index queries via | lookup directives."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/13alvone/SpeakesQuery/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"8f7bdf3f81bbe2b6ee6cfefa7df442280261dff65c343de5b62488c7dc1dac9e","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T10:38:43.329Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T10:38:43.329Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Pipe-powered search over everything you ingest - on hardware you own.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/13alvone/SpeakesQuery/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"optional","text":"Everything runs on your machine: no accounts, no telemetry, no cloud dependency. (The optional AI features call the Anthropic API or a model on your own GPU - your choice.)","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/13alvone/SpeakesQuery/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"No connectors, API keys, or waiting for schedules required.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/13alvone/SpeakesQuery/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"Script Library - A curated, tested collection of 131 premade ingestion scripts (97 need no API key at all) spanning markets (Polymarket, Kalshi, Manifold, Metaculus), economics (FRED, BLS, Treasury yields), securities (SEC EDGAR, options chains), crypto (CoinGecko), news/events (federal register, GDELT, Hacker News), and more.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/13alvone/SpeakesQuery/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"8f7bdf3f81bbe2b6ee6cfefa7df442280261dff65c343de5b62488c7dc1dac9e","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/13alvone/SpeakesQuery/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-03T10:38:43.329Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-14T18:19:59Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/13alvone/SpeakesQuery/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-03T10:38:43.329Z","hash":"8f7bdf3f81bbe2b6ee6cfefa7df442280261dff65c343de5b62488c7dc1dac9e","originalBytes":27054,"storedBytes":27054,"truncated":fal